Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.12,0:00:09.60,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,A surprising amount of the things \Nyou see in nature are poisonous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:15.51,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,One might simply make you sick to \Nyour stomach, or slightly numb...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.51,0:00:19.03,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But combining them together \Nand refining the result
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.03,0:00:21.78,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,will make a poison that can \Nkill even a Red Grizzly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.73,0:00:25.83,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Alchemy's scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.23,0:00:29.28,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I know I said I'd help with \Nyour experiments, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.30,0:00:34.14,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Isn't that going to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.30,0:02:12.46,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Well? Need an antidote spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.46,0:02:17.19,Main - Top,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm fine. It just tasted terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.86,0:02:19.07,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord2\fs17\fade(1000,100)\c&H908A88&\3c&H000000&\pos(234.232,276.502)}Undead\NAdventurer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.19,0:02:20.91,Main - Top,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You may be the first person in history \Nwho was able to drink that poison
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.91,0:02:23.28,Main - Top,Lorraine,0,0,0,,and say how it tastes, Rentt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.80,0:02:27.86,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,As I thought, no poison will work on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.13,0:02:33.00,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But for some reason, healing \Nherbs and potions do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.86,0:02:37.35,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Your body's quite handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.49,0:02:42.78,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Wait, do you still not feel the \Nneed for sleep, even as a ghast?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.07,0:02:45.17,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.17,0:02:47.35,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I barely need to sleep at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.35,0:02:49.29,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I'm jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.29,0:02:51.45,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,What about your appetite?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.59,0:02:58.14,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's small, but I do feel a desire \Nfor human flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.87,0:03:02.61,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,More poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.88,0:03:04.24,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.79,0:03:14.83,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.50,0:03:17.53,Main,C,0,0,0,,It's my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.53,0:03:20.20,Main,C,0,0,0,,I've cast preservation magic on the vial.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.55,0:03:24.21,Main,C,0,0,0,,You may feel reluctant \Nto ingest human blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.21,0:03:28.65,Main,C,0,0,0,,but you should ingest it at regular \Nintervals to keep yourself from losing control.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.23,0:03:31.50,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.23,0:03:39.63,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.38,0:03:42.41,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You only need one drop?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.41,0:03:45.90,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's plenty. The thirst is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.90,0:03:47.92,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'll make it last.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.25,0:03:53.59,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm going to head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:55.96,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You get some rest, Lorraine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.20,0:03:57.55,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,The labyrinth?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.55,0:04:00.97,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm heading to the labyrinth, \Nyes, but first, the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.97,0:04:02.16,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,The guild?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.16,0:04:03.75,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm going to take a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.04,0:04:06.33,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You're going to need to show Rentt Faina's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.33,0:04:09.40,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,adventurer ID if you want \Na job from the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.40,0:04:12.92,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,If you bring it out looking like that, \Nthe whole guild will be in an uproar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.92,0:04:14.22,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.22,0:04:18.27,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Sure, I look different.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.27,0:04:20.74,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But I'm just a Bronze-class adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.06,0:04:23.48,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Nobody will care.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.39,0:04:30.73,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Listen, Rentt. You're one of \Nmany Bronze adventurers, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.73,0:04:33.54,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But the guild really liked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.87,0:04:37.42,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You did everything from \Nhelping out new adventurers
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:39.53,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,to taking jobs nobody else would take.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.78,0:04:41.66,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Those were just random little jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.66,0:04:44.17,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Don't be so hard on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.17,0:04:47.71,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,There was talk of recruiting \Nyou to work for the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.12,0:04:49.56,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.56,0:04:51.26,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.68,0:04:56.34,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Maybe if I were a really talented \Nadventurer, but I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.95,0:05:00.26,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,They probably found it hard \Nto bring the subject up,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.26,0:05:02.57,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,since you showed no signs of retiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.83,0:05:04.85,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.85,0:05:07.84,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Even I know some people at the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.83,0:05:11.03,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm grateful they thought that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.30,0:05:16.04,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But I'm not going to retire, \Nor work at the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.04,0:05:17.70,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,That's what we all assumed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.43,0:05:20.34,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Now, let's think about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:23.27,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You need to pass a test to go up a rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.27,0:05:25.84,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,And to take that test, you \Nneed to prove yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.84,0:05:30.36,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You need to be the one taking the quests.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.63,0:05:36.47,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But if the guild knows that \NRentt Faina is back...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:38.71,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:42.06,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Just be somebody else!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:56.69,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,It feels like it's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.68,0:06:02.31,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Oh, there's Sheila!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.81,0:06:03.97,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Looks like she's doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.44,0:06:08.25,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Good morning. Is it your first time here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.05,0:06:13.71,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I want to register as an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.71,0:06:18.02,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,All right. You'll need to do some paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.02,0:06:21.97,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I can fill out all of it except your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.97,0:06:23.99,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I know how to read and write.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.99,0:06:25.60,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.60,0:06:28.24,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,You can leave any parts that \Nare too hard for you blank.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.24,0:06:31.48,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,But if you put down any skills \Nyou have or magic you can use,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.48,0:06:33.86,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,we'll be able to give you more jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:37.71,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,The last time I filled this \Nout was 10 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.71,0:06:41.26,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Back then, I didn't even know \Nwhat counted as a "skill,"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:43.87,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,and I could only write down my name and age.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.45,0:06:46.38,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Not like now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.93,0:06:51.15,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,But my goal hasn't changed \Nat all since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.17,0:06:56.68,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt, why not register as an \Nadventurer under another name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.68,0:07:00.57,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,I can't do that! Using two different \Nnames is against the guild rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.57,0:07:03.18,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,They'll never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.18,0:07:06.22,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,And even if they do find out, \Nit won't be a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.66,0:07:09.03,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Everyone knows Rentt Faina, and they'd have
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.03,0:07:12.19,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,no end of questions about \Nhow you ended up that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.46,0:07:16.77,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,But nobody will ask questions \Nabout a wandering adventurer,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.77,0:07:19.21,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,no matter how strange they look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.79,0:07:21.30,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.30,0:07:25.28,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Well, you'll lose what \Naccomplishments Rentt Faina had,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.28,0:07:30.48,Flashback,Lorraine,0,0,0,,and you'll have to start over from Iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.48,0:07:31.74,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.24,0:07:33.92,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,My goal is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.50,0:07:38.46,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,to become a Mythril-class \Nadventurer someday. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.06,0:07:40.84,Main,Shiela,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.38,0:07:46.26,Main,Shiela,0,0,0,,Your name is... Rentt Vivier, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.12,0:07:48.18,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.18,0:07:54.95,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Nothing, just... an adventurer named \NRentt went missing the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:57.98,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,She was worried? About somebody like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.52,0:08:00.86,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Well, we did know each \Nother for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.86,0:08:05.15,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. It just surprised \Nme that you had the same name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.15,0:08:06.63,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.63,0:08:09.50,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,By the way, was that Rentt Faina?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.17,0:08:12.96,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Yes, but how did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.27,0:08:15.31,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Lorraine told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.31,0:08:20.00,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Are you a relative of hers?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.00,0:08:22.97,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yes. She's letting me stay with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.29,0:08:27.97,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I'd heard that an unusual-looking man \Nwas seen going in and out of her home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.97,0:08:29.56,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,So that was you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.13,0:08:32.55,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,There were rumors about me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.80,0:08:36.77,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I was so sure it was Rentt Faina.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.23,0:08:41.04,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,He seemed so close to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.05,0:08:46.03,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,All right. This paperwork looks fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.03,0:08:48.28,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Give me a minute to finish this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.02,0:08:54.43,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm glad I said I was a relative.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.43,0:08:56.59,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Lorraine is a young woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.59,0:08:59.37,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I need to make sure there aren't \Nweird rumors about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.92,0:09:03.94,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,The name "Rentt" is a common \None in every country.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.33,0:09:08.38,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,And it's not unusual for an adventurer \Nto look a little strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:11.26,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Now I can start over!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.05,0:09:13.64,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Rentt Vivier!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.64,0:09:15.31,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Oh, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.57,0:09:18.69,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,You are now an Iron-class adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.69,0:09:20.40,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Do your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.74,0:09:22.15,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.15,0:09:25.89,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Just... don't get yourself killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.79,0:09:27.72,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.46,0:09:43.76,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Goblins?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.15,0:09:46.53,Main,Laura,0,0,0,,Ryze, behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.14,0:09:48.63,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Still young...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.63,0:09:50.37,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,They sound like children.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:02.67,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,A swordsman and a healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.67,0:10:05.04,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Given their age, they must be new.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.69,0:10:09.32,Italics,Ryze,0,0,0,,Laura!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.32,0:10:10.33,Italics,Laura,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.93,0:10:17.30,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,They seem to be working well together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.30,0:10:18.69,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,They'll probably be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.42,0:10:23.96,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I used to always talk to the \Nnew kids, show them around...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.96,0:10:26.81,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,But I'd just scare them, looking like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.55,0:10:37.16,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Now, then... time to hurry before the \Nother adventurers find that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.74,0:10:48.99,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Information about the labyrinth \Nis valuable, and worth money.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.99,0:10:52.92,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Especially information about \Nnewly discovered areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.70,0:10:57.29,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,If I can explore this new area \Nand report it to the guild,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.29,0:10:59.49,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,it'll be a huge accomplishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.21,0:11:03.49,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,For the Iron-class \Nadventurer, Rentt Vivier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.25,0:11:08.01,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Now, let's see what's waiting for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.69,0:11:37.07,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's not an undead...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.23,0:11:43.49,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Somebody was living here? \NInside the labyrinth?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.98,0:11:48.05,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.04,0:11:55.87,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,I'll ask you one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.48,0:12:00.21,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.08,0:12:04.30,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Oh no... this woman's bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.94,0:12:08.80,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I was searching to see if \Nthere was anything here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.80,0:12:10.91,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.91,0:12:13.87,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,Searching, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.87,0:12:15.41,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,Searching...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.41,0:12:18.21,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,For something to steal, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.05,0:12:22.66,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,Does that mean you're \Nprepared to die down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.03,0:12:27.08,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,There are some things even I can't forgive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.66,0:12:30.28,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,I don't want this place disturbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.93,0:12:36.12,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,So... disappear, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.23,0:13:04.58,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,Your body...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.88,0:13:06.54,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Does it offend you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.19,0:13:11.30,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I didn't end up like this \Nbecause I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.34,0:13:17.32,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,I assume so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.32,0:13:22.33,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,But at least it explains how you got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.56,0:13:26.62,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,It seems I've misunderstood you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.62,0:13:28.29,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.04,0:13:31.50,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,Oh, you're upset, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.50,0:13:34.00,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,I burnt your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.00,0:13:37.33,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,No, you almost killed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.56,0:13:39.99,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,In exchange...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.65,0:13:47.66,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,I'll offer you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.45,0:13:52.51,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,It's well-made, and worth more \Nthan what you were wearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.06,0:13:56.44,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,She said she "misunderstood" me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.71,0:14:00.38,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Does that mean she doesn't \Nfeel like killing me anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.21,0:14:06.85,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,I'm sure you understand that \Nthis place is special.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:11.43,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,Would you be willing to keep it a secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.04,0:14:16.46,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,This room is a special place to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.45,0:14:19.53,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You mean don't tell the guild?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.53,0:14:22.72,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,Yes, that's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.72,0:14:26.91,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,Though, actually, no one can enter \Nthis place unless you're with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.03,0:14:32.67,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,Oh, if you're an adventurer, you wouldn't \Nwant to go home empty-handed, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.15,0:14:36.82,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,I'll give you this Acacia Map instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.82,0:14:39.31,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,I'm sure it will be of use to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.32,0:14:47.51,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,A map?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.06,0:14:54.57,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,It's a magic item that will automatically record \Nthe spaces through which its owner has traveled.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.27,0:14:59.32,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,Our trade is now complete, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.36,0:15:03.63,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,I'll return you to the entrance, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.77,0:15:09.81,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,I wish you good health... Though perhaps \Nthat's not the best thing to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.53,0:15:22.35,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Are you under some kind of curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.35,0:15:25.56,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,The strangest things keep \Nhappening to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.56,0:15:28.52,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm not running into them \Nbecause I want to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.52,0:15:31.22,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,And that's why I said it was a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.22,0:15:36.30,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Well, an adventurer's job is \Ngoing to see strange things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.72,0:15:40.68,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Anyway, this magic item... \Nit doesn't seem cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.68,0:15:42.42,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It seems safe to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.71,0:15:45.25,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Any idea how to use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.25,0:15:48.83,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It didn't react to my magic at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.83,0:15:51.47,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You try it, Rentt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.85,0:16:01.06,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,This is the Labyrinth of \Nthe Moon's Reflection.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.06,0:16:03.22,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It really is a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.22,0:16:04.99,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.77,0:16:07.56,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,What's this mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.20,0:16:09.41,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm not sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.93,0:16:15.55,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,"Ryze" and "Laura"...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.05,0:16:19.32,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Those seem to be names, but what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.32,0:16:21.37,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,A pair of rookie adventurers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.37,0:16:23.50,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I met them in the labyrinth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.50,0:16:28.90,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Then it's showing you the names of the people \Nin the labyrinth, as well as their positions?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.90,0:16:30.25,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.25,0:16:33.76,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt, this is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:35.51,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It's a potential national treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.80,0:16:37.46,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I can't believe this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.46,0:16:39.58,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Can you bring up maps for \Nthe other labyrinths?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.58,0:16:41.64,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm not sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.64,0:16:43.86,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Other labyrinths...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.86,0:16:46.38,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,The Labyrinth of the New Moon, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.23,0:16:51.87,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.87,0:16:54.64,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But it's not complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.64,0:16:55.97,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It's not?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.97,0:16:56.95,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.95,0:17:02.20,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Actually, she said it would record the \Nspaces in the labyrinth that I'd traveled.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.36,0:17:09.25,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,So it won't display any areas that its\Nowner, that is, you, haven't been to?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.59,0:17:13.13,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Hey, can you take a look at this robe, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.13,0:17:15.69,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I don't want another curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.69,0:17:17.33,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.33,0:17:19.26,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You already have it equipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.26,0:17:21.65,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,If it was cursed, you'd know by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.19,0:17:28.22,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,From the look of it, it's of good quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.22,0:17:29.49,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.49,0:17:33.37,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Yes. It has extremely \Nstrong magic resistance,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.37,0:17:35.17,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,and no blade could pierce it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.17,0:17:39.45,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You can safely assume it's far \Nstronger than regular armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.82,0:17:42.96,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Maybe I got a better deal \Nout of this than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:45.99,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Rentt, that's not what you \Nneed to be thinking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.56,0:17:51.13,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Who is this woman who almost killed you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.42,0:17:53.84,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.77,0:17:57.08,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,She was incredibly powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.95,0:18:04.20,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,But at my level of strength, all I can say \Nis that she's stronger than a Gold-class.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.20,0:18:05.33,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.79,0:18:08.75,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,I'm curious about the room you went to, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.09,0:18:14.04,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,It means somebody has the ability to make \Nliving spaces within the labyrinth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.04,0:18:16.54,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm going back tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.54,0:18:18.43,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,Even though you were almost killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.43,0:18:20.00,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,That's brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.00,0:18:22.77,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,She didn't tell me to never come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.77,0:18:25.57,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,She just told me not to tell the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.57,0:18:27.49,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,You don't know if that's how she sees it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.76,0:18:33.51,Main,Lorraine,0,0,0,,From what you said, she clearly \Nwants to be left alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.31,0:18:37.61,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Well, I'll go talk to her, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.18,0:18:44.78,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm cursed, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.33,0:18:52.46,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,What Lorraine said was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:57.28,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,On the day I found that new area in the \NLabyrinth of the Moon's Reflection...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.28,0:19:00.17,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I met the dragon and became undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.90,0:19:03.46,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I still can't get this cursed mask off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.90,0:19:06.50,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,Most people would take pity on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.22,0:19:10.28,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,But... I don't feel that way at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.31,0:19:18.82,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,I've fought powerful enemies, encountered \Nmany mysteries... and gotten stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.46,0:19:23.97,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's just what a Mythril-class \Nadventurer does!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.86,0:19:35.82,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,It's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.30,0:19:39.66,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,The entrance is gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.62,0:19:50.88,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,So she doesn't want me coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.24,0:19:56.39,Italics,Rentt,0,0,0,,No, she doesn't want me \Ncoming back right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.67,0:20:00.50,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.79,0:20:03.74,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,The client was very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.74,0:20:05.34,Main,Young Adventurer,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.70,0:20:09.05,Main,Young Adventurer,0,0,0,,Hey, have you heard anything about Rentt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.58,0:20:11.27,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Nothing, yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.27,0:20:12.65,Main,Young Adventurer,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.65,0:20:15.98,Main,Young Adventurer,0,0,0,,Well, maybe he went off to escort \Nsome traveler or something, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.37,0:20:18.70,Main,Young Adventurer,0,0,0,,Tell me if you ever hear something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.70,0:20:19.73,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.56,0:20:25.07,Italics,Sheila,0,0,0,,Rentt, everyone is worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.68,0:20:31.14,Italics,Sheila,0,0,0,,A lot of people learned how \Nto be an adventurer from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.71,0:20:36.36,Italics,Sheila,0,0,0,,I only learned how to be a real \Nguild employee thanks to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.41,0:20:39.26,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,I'm "nice"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.26,0:20:40.27,Flashback,Sheila,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.27,0:20:42.46,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,I've never seen myself that way...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:46.67,Flashback,Rentt,0,0,0,,But well, I'll do anything if \Nit helps me become Mythril.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.32,0:20:51.21,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.97,0:20:55.14,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.14,0:20:58.40,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I was just thinking about something, \Nand you startled me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.81,0:21:01.31,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,That's fine... actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.75,0:21:03.74,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I want to take this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.82,0:21:08.02,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Three bodies' worth of orc flesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.02,0:21:11.59,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,The deadline's not for a while, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.93,0:21:16.97,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Orcs are quite strong. And you'll \Nneed to fight three of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.97,0:21:19.53,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I can't recommend that for \Nan Iron-class adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.53,0:21:21.97,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I know how strong orcs are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.39,0:21:27.80,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,You'd need to be an average Bronze-class, \Nno, a fairly strong one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.80,0:21:28.83,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.83,0:21:33.14,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I've defeated \Norcs before, several times.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.58,0:21:35.36,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.36,0:21:38.37,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,If you've already fought them, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.81,0:21:43.28,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,The guild will entrust you, \NRentt Vivier, with this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.09,0:21:45.29,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.91,0:21:48.43,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Just don't do anything risky, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.43,0:21:50.70,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,If it gets dangerous, then run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.70,0:21:51.78,Main,Sheila,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:55.95,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,Yes. I've only got one life, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.95,0:21:57.40,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.40,0:21:58.26,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.35,0:22:03.49,Main,Rentt,0,0,0,,I think I understand that \Nbetter than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.64,0:23:39.97,Title,Rentt,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord2\fs33\c&H2B2C54&\3c&HC5E4F6&\b0\pos(210.938,273.286)}Bronze-class Exam
